# Claude Code local tooling config.
#
# Ignored per file, not as a directory: git does not descend into an excluded
# directory, so a `!` rule for something inside `.claude/` would never match.
# The reviewer definitions in .claude/agents are project documentation - they
# encode how this codebase is meant to be audited - and are tracked.
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json
